msgstr "Eval ນີ້ສົ່ງຄ່າເກົ່າກັບຄືນມາ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດບໍ່ຊ້ຳກັນໄດ້."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/generators/relation.py:0
msgid "Unique cannot be used with the '%s' generator."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ Unique ກັບຕົວສ້າງ '%s' ໄດ້."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/generators/scalar.py:0
msgid "Unique cannot be used with the boolean generator."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ Unique ກັບຕົວສ້າງ boolean ໄດ້."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/generators/choice.py:0
msgid "Unique cannot be used with the selection generator."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ Unique ກັບຕົວສ້າງ selection ໄດ້."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/models/blueprint.py:0
msgid "Unknown <import> attribute(s): %(attributes)s."
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະ <import> ທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ: %(attributes)s."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/models/blueprint.py:0
msgid "Unknown field(s) on '%(model)s': %(fields)s."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກໃນ '%(model)s': %(fields)s."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/models/blueprint.py:0
msgid "Unknown model '%(model)s'."
msgstr "ໂມເດວທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ '%(model)s'."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/models/blueprint.py:0
msgid "Unknown operation '%(operation)s'."
msgstr "ການດຳເນີນການທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ '%(operation)s'."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/models/blueprint.py:0
#: code:addons/populate/models/job.py:0
msgid "Unknown or non-callable method '%(method)s' on '%(model)s'."
msgstr "Method '%(method)s' ໃນ '%(model)s' ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/generators/choice.py:0
msgid "Values cannot be empty for the %s generator."
msgstr "ຄ່າບໍ່ສາມາດຫວ່າງເປົ່າໄດ້ສຳລັບຕົວສ້າງ %s."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/generators/misc.py:0
msgid "Values cannot be empty for the cycle generator."
msgstr "ຄ່າບໍ່ສາມາດຫວ່າງເປົ່າໄດ້ສຳລັບຕົວສ້າງ cycle."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/generators/misc.py:0
msgid "Weights cannot be provided for the cycle generator."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸນ້ຳໜັກສຳລັບຕົວສ້າງ cycle ໄດ້."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/generators/misc.py:0
msgid ""
"When step is negative, end (%(end)s) must be less than start (%(start)s)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ step ເປັນຄ່າລົບ, ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດ (%(end)s) ຕ້ອງນ້ອຍກວ່າຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (%(start)s)."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/generators/misc.py:0
msgid ""
"When step is positive, end (%(end)s) must be greater than start (%(start)s)."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອ step ເປັນຄ່າບວກ, ຈຸດສິ້ນສຸດ (%(end)s) ຕ້ອງໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (%(start)s)."

#. module: populate
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:populate.selection__populate_job__operation__write
msgid "Write"
msgstr "ຂຽນ"

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/models/blueprint.py:0
msgid "Write blocks use 'ref', not 'id'."
msgstr "ບລັອກ Write ໃຊ້ 'ref', ບໍ່ແມ່ນ 'id'."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/models/blueprint.py:0
msgid "You cannot create recursive inherited blueprints."
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງແບບແຜນສືບທອດແບບວົນຊ້ຳໄດ້."

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/generators/properties.py:0
msgid ""
"`possible_values` must be provided for prop_type '%(prop_type)s' in "
"generator %(generator_name)s of field %(field_name)s"
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸ `possible_values` ສຳລັບ prop_type '%(prop_type)s' ໃນຕົວສ້າງ %"
"(generator_name)s ຂອງຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ %(field_name)s"

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/generators/properties.py:0
msgid ""
"`possible_values` must be provided when `allowed_types` includes 'selection' "
"or 'tags'. "
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອງລະບຸ `possible_values` ເມື່ອ `allowed_types` ລວມມີ 'selection' ຫຼື 'tags'. "

#. module: populate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/populate/generators/properties.py:0
msgid ""
"`prop_type` expected to be in fields.Properties.ALLOWED_TYPES '%(allowed)s'. "
"Got %(actual)s instead."
msgstr ""
"`prop_type` ຄວນຢູ່ໃນ fields.Properties.ALLOWED_TYPES '%(allowed)s'. ແຕ່ໄດ້ຮັບ %"
"(actual)s ແທນ."

